# CODEOWNERS
#
# Required reviewers per path. Order matters: later rules override earlier ones.
# Team handles (not individuals) are used to keep ownership durable across
# personnel changes and to comply with GDPR data-minimisation.
#
# TODO(platform-leads): replace the placeholder teams below with the real
# GitHub team slugs before enabling branch protection. Until then, this file
# documents intent and is enforced only where the teams exist.
#
# Reference: https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

