# Production lists THREE teams. GitHub CODEOWNERS semantics: a single
# matching line is satisfied when ANY ONE listed owner approves (any owner can
# also block by requesting changes) — it does NOT require all three to approve.
# If policy requires sign-off from platform-leads AND security-reviewers AND
# the site team, that must be enforced with branch-protection required-review
# settings, not by this line alone. See AGENTS.md §5.1. An administrator must
# confirm these team slugs exist and have write access before enabling
# protection; until then production stays disabled.
/inventories/production/                @custos-arcae/platform-leads @custos-arcae/security-reviewers @custos-arcae/site-lt-vilnius
/inventories/production/lt-vilnius-01/  @custos-arcae/platform-leads @custos-arcae/security-reviewers @custos-arcae/site-lt-vilnius

